{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13653","headline":"哭灵一上人 · 严维","name":"哭灵一上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一公何不住，空有远公名。\n共说岑山路，今时不可行。\n旧房松更老，新塔草初生。\n经论传缁侣，文章遍墨卿。\n禅林枝干折，法宇栋梁倾。\n谁复修僧史，应知传已成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}